, 39, 40, 41, 48, 66, 71</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">5G bands</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">1, 2, 3, 5, 7, 12, 14, 20, 25, 26, 28, 29, 30, 38, 40, 41, 48, 66, 70, 71, 77, 78 SA/NSA/Sub6</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Speed</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">HSPA, LTE, 5G</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></details><details class=\"collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200 border border-base-300\"><summary class=\"collapse-title font-semibold text-base\">Launch</summary><div class=\"collapse-content\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"table table-sm w-full\"><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Announced</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">2026, April 29</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Status</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">Available. Released 2026, May 14</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></details><details class=\"collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200 border border-base-300\"><summary class=\"collapse-title font-semibold text-base\">Body</summary><div class=\"collapse-content\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"table table-sm w-full\"><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Dimensions</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">Unfolded: 171.5 x 74 x 7.2 mmFolded: 88.1 x 74 x 15.7 mm</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Weight</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">199 g (7.02 oz)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Build</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">Plastic front (unfolded), glass front (folded, Gorilla Glass Ceramic), aluminum frame</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">SIM</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">Nano-SIM + eSIM</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Other</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">IP48 dust and water resistant (dust &gt; 1mm; immersible up to 1.5m for 30 min)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></details><details class=\"collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200 border border-base-300\"><summary class=\"collapse-title font-semibold text-base\">Display</summary><div class=\"collapse-content\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"table table-sm w-full\"><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Type</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">Foldable LTPO AMOLED, 1B colors, 165Hz, Dolby Vision, HDR10+, 5000 nits (peak)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Size</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">7.0 inches, 110.8 cm2 (~87.3% screen-to-body ratio)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Resolution</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">1224 x 2992 pixels (~462 ppi density)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Other</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">Second external LTPO AMOLED, 1B colors, Dolby Vision, 165Hz, HDR10+, 3000 nits (peak)\n4 inches, 1272 x 1080 pixels, 417 ppi, Gorilla Glass Ceramic</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></details><details class=\"collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200 border border-base-300\"><summary class=\"collapse-title font-semibold text-base\">Platform</summary><div class=\"collapse-content\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"table table-sm w-full\"><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">OS</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">Android 16</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Chipset</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">Qualcomm SM8750-AB Snapdragon 8 Elite (3 nm)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">CPU</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">Octa-core (2x4.47 GHz Oryon V2 Phoenix L + 6x3.53 GHz Oryon V2 Phoenix M)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">GPU</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">Adreno 830 (1200 MHz)</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></details><details class=\"collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200 border border-base-300\"><summary class=\"collapse-title font-semibold text-base\">Memory</summary><div class=\"collapse-content\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"table table-sm w-full\"><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Card slot</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">No</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Internal</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">512GB 16GB RAM</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Other</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">UFS 4.0</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></details><details class=\"collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200 border border-base-300\"><summary class=\"collapse-title font-semibold text-base\">Main Camera</summary><div class=\"collapse-content\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"table table-sm w-full\"><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Dual</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">50 MP, f/1.8, (wide), 1/1.56&quot;, 1.0µm, PDAF, OIS\n50 MP, f/2.0, 122˚ (ultrawide), 1/2.93&quot;, 0.6µm</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Features</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">LED flash, panorama, HDR, Pantone Validated Colour and Skin Tones</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Video</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">8K@30fps, 4K@30/60/120fps, 1080p@30/60/120/240fps, Dolby Vision, HDR10+</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></details><details class=\"collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200 border border-base-300\"><summary class=\"collapse-title font-semibold text-base\">Selfie camera</summary><div class=\"collapse-content\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"table table-sm w-full\"><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Single</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">50 MP, f/2.0, (wide), 0.64µm</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Video</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">4K@30/60fps, 1080p@30/60fps</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></details><details class=\"collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200 border border-base-300\"><summary class=\"collapse-title font-semibold text-base\">Sound</summary><div class=\"collapse-content\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"table table-sm w-full\"><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Loudspeaker</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">Yes, with stereo speakers (with Dolby Atmos)</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">3.5mm jack</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">No</td></tr></tbody></table></div></div></details><details class=\"collapse collapse-arrow bg-base-200 border border-base-300\"><summary class=\"collapse-title font-semibold text-base\">Comms</summary><div class=\"collapse-content\"><div class=\"overflow-x-auto\"><table class=\"table table-sm w-full\"><tbody><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">WLAN</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">Wi-Fi 802.11 a/b/g/n/ac/6e/7, tri-band</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Bluetooth</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">5.4, A2DP, LE</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">Positioning</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">GPS, GALILEO, GLONASS, BDS, QZSS</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b border-base-300 last:border-0\"><td class=\"w-40 font-medium text-base-content/60 align-top\">NFC</td><td class=\"text-base-content/90 whitespace-pre-line\">Yes</td></tr><tr class=\"border-b b